       "type": "text",
       "text": {
        "content": "Memory gives an agent continuity. RAG gives it accuracy. A business agent that can hold a coherent conversation but cannot access the organisation's actual knowledge is still unreliable at the moment it matters most when a client asks a specific question that only the business can answer correctly.",
        "link": null
       },
       "annotations": {
